{"name":"Birthday King","hex":"#9bdcb9","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"birthday","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The anniversary of the day on which someone is born. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","The anniversary of the day on which something is created."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To celebrate one's birthday."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/birthday"},{"term":"king","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A male monarch; a man who heads a monarchy; in an absolute monarchy, the supreme ruler of his nation.","The monarch with the most power and authority in a monarchy, regardless of sex."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To crown king, to make (a person) king.","To rule over as king."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/king"}],"entries":[{"title":"Birthday","blocks":[{"text":"A birthday is the anniversary of the birth of a person or the figurative birth of an institution. Birthdays of people are celebrated in numerous cultures, often with birthday gifts, birthday cards, a birthday party, or a rite of passage."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/83/Happy_family_2.jpg/330px-Happy_family_2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Birthday","wikidata":"Q47223"},{"title":"King","blocks":[{"text":"King is a royal title given to a male monarch. A king is an absolute monarch if he holds unrestricted governmental power or exercises full sovereignty over a nation. In a modern context, the title may refer to the ruler of one of a number of modern monarchies. The title of king is used alongside other titles for monarchs: in the West, emperor, grand prince, prince, archduke, duke or grand duke, and in the Islamic world, malik, sultan, emir or hakim, among others."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b5/Aachen_Domschatz_Bueste1.jpg/330px-Aachen_Domschatz